know faith.",1423,71.66,48.58,{{9121,"The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas","Archmage Angela Dosantos",1423,71.7,48.69,60,"B",60},{9033,"Echoes of War","Commander Eligor Dawnbringer",1423,71.72,48.59,60,"B",60},{9113,"Circlet of Faith","Father Inigo Montoy",1423,71.66,48.58,60,"B",60}},1},{9058,"Cryptstalker Boots","B",60,60,"Huntsman Leopold","Eastern Plaguelands",1423,71.69,48.94,"","Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Boots if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Boots, 12 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals.","Echoes of War",0,0,"200 Argent Dawn",{22440},{},"I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.\n\nBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",1423,71.69,48.94,{{9121,"The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas","Archmage Angela Dosantos",1423,71.7,48.69,60,"B",60},{9033,"Echoes of War","Commander Eligor Dawnbringer",1423,71.72,48.59,60,"B",60},{9058,"Cryptstalker Boots","Huntsman Leopold",1423,71.69,48.94,60,"B",60}},1},{9060,"Cryptstalker Girdle","B",60,60,"Huntsman Leopold","Eastern Plaguelands",1423,71.69,48.94,"","Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Cryptstalker Girdle if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Girdle, 8 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals.","Echoes of War",0,0,"200 Argent Dawn",{22442},{},"I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas.\n\nBring me the items I require and I shall fashion for you a suit of armor the likes of which has never before been seen in our world!",1423,71.69,4