 the Eastern Plaguelands wants 5 Frozen Runes, 4 Bolts of Runecloth, 2 Essences of Water, 4 Ironweb Spider Silks and 200 gold. You must also be of Exalted reputation with the Argent Dawn.","Omarion's Handbook",0,0,"",{22658},{},"Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create a Glacial cloak. All you need to do is bring me the materials and pay a small crafting fee.",1423,71.24,49.9,{{9233,"Omarion's Handbook","",0,0,0,60,"B",60},{9237,"Glacial Cloak","Craftsman Wilhelm",1423,71.24,49.9,60,"B",60}},1},{9239,"Glacial Gloves","B",60,60,"Craftsman Wilhelm","Eastern Plaguelands",1423,71.24,49.9,"","Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 5 Frozen Runes, 4 Bolts of Runecloth, 4 Essences of Water, 2 Ironweb Spider Silks and 200 gold.","Omarion's Handbook",0,0,"",{22654},{},"Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create Glacial gloves. All you need to do is bring me the materials and pay a small crafting fee.",1423,71.24,49.9,{{9233,"Omarion's Handbook","",0,0,0,60,"B",60},{9239,"Glacial Gloves","Craftsman Wilhelm",1423,71.24,49.9,60,"B",60}},1},{9240,"Glacial Vest","B",60,60,"Craftsman Wilhelm","Eastern Plaguelands",1423,71.24,49.9,"","Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 8 Frozen Runes, 8 Bolts of Runecloth, 6 Essences of Water, 4 Ironweb Spider Silks and 300 gold. You must also be of Exalted reputation with the Argent Dawn.","Omarion's Handbook",0,0,"",{22652},{},"Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create a Glacial vest. All you need to do is bring me the materials and pay a small crafting fee.",1423,71.24,49.9,{{9233,"Omarion's Handbook","",0,0,0,60,"B",60},{9240,"Glacial Vest","Craftsman Wilhelm",1423,71.24,49.9,60,"B",60}},1},{9238,"Glacial Wrists","B",60,60,"Craftsman Wilhelm","Eastern Plaguelands",1423,71.24,49.9,"","Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 4 Frozen Runes, 2 Bolts of Runecloth, 2 Essences of Water, 2 Ironweb Spider Silks and 200 gold.","Omarion's Handbook",0,0,"",{22655},{},"Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create Glacial wrists. All you need to do is bring me the materials and pay a small crafting fee.",1423,71.24,49.9,{{9233,"Omarion's Handbook","",0,0,0,60,"B",60},{9238,"Glacial Wrists","Craftsman Wilhelm",1423,71.24,49.9,60,"B",60}},1},{9116,"Gloves of Faith","B",60,60,"Father Inigo Montoy","Eastern Plaguelands",1423,71.66,48.58,"","Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Gloves of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Gloves, 8 Wartorn Cloth Scraps and 4 Mooncloth.","Echoes of War",0,0,"200 Argent Dawn",{22517},{},"<Father Montoy makes some strange gestures in the air in front of you.>\n\nBlessed boy, have you found the vestments of the fallen? The poor souls whose last breaths were taken on the field of battle - stripped of everything including their dignity.\n\nBring me the desecrated remnants of the departed along with reagents of purification and you shall know faith.",1423,71.66,48.58,{{9121,"The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas","Archmage Angela Dosantos",1423,71.7,48.69,60,"B",60},{9033,"Echoes of War","Commander Eligor Dawnbringer",1423,71.72,48.59,60,"B",60},{9116,"Gloves of Faith","Father Inigo Montoy",1423,71.66,48.58,60,"B",60}},1},{9235,"Icebane Bracers","B",60,60,"Craftsman Wilhelm","Eastern Plaguelands",1423,71.24,49.9,"","Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 4 Frozen Runes, 12 Thorium Bars, 2 Arcanite Bars, 2 Essence of Water and 200 gold.","Omarion's Handbook",0,0,"",{22671},{},"Thanks to you and Omarion (May he rest in peace), I am now able to create Icebane bracers. All you need to do is bring me the materials and pay a small crafting fee.",1423,71.24,49.9,{{9233,"Omarion's Handbook","",0,0,0,60,"B",60},{9235,"Icebane Bracers","Craftsman Wilhelm",1423,71.24,49.9,60,"B",60}},1},{9236,"Icebane Breastplate","B",60,60,"Craftsman Wilhelm","Eastern Plaguelands",1423,71.24,49.9,"","Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 8 Frozen Runes, 16 Thorium Bars, 2 Arcanite Bars, 4 Essence of Water and 300 gold. You will also need to be of Exalted reputation with the Argent Dawn.","Omarion's Handbook",0,0,"",{22669},{},"Thanks to you and Omarion (May he rest in peace), I am now able to create an Icebane breastplate. All you need to do is bring me the materials and pay a small crafting fee.",1423,71.24,49.9,{{9233,"Omarion's Handbook","",0,0,0,60,"B",60},{9236,"Icebane Breastplate","Craftsman Wilhelm",1423,71.24,49.9,60,"B",60}},1},{9234,"Icebane Gauntlets","B",60,60,"Craftsman Wilhelm","Eastern Plaguelands",1423,71.24,49.9,"","Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 5 Frozen Runes, 12 Thorium Bars, 2 Arcanite Bars, 2 Essences of Water and 200 gold.","Omarion's Handbook",0,0,"",{22670},{},"Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create Icebane gauntlets. All you need to do is bring me the materials and pay a small crafting fee.",1423,71.24,49.9,{{9233,"Omarion's Handbook","",0,0,0,60,"B",60},{9234,"Icebane Gauntlets","Craftsman Wilhelm",1423,71.24,49.9,60,"B",60}},1},{9244,"Icy Scale Bracers","B",60,60,"Craftsman Wilhelm","Eastern Plaguelands",1423,71.24,49.9,"","Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 4 Frozen Runes, 16 Heavy Scorpid Scales, 5 Essences of Water, 3 Cured Rugged Hides and 200 gold.","Omarion's Handbook",0,0,"",{22665},{},"Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create Icy Scale bracers. All you need to do is bring me the materials and pay a small crafting fee.",1423,71.24,49.9,{{9233,"Omarion's Handbook","",0,0,0,60,"B",60},{9244,"Icy Scale Bracers","Craftsman Wilhelm",1423,71.24,49.9,60,"B",60}},1},{9246,"Icy Scale Breastplate","B",60,60,"Craftsman Wilhelm","Eastern Plaguelands",1423,71.24,49.9,"","Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 8 Frozen Runes, 24 Heavy Scorpid Scale, 7 Essence of Water, 5 Cured Rugged Hides and 300 gold. You must also be of Exalted reputation with the Argent Dawn.","Omarion's Handbook",0,0,"",{22664},{},"Thanks to you and Omarion (May he rest in peace), I am now able to create an Icy Scale breastplate. All you need to do is bring me the materials and pay a small crafting fee.",1423,71.24,49.9,{{9233,"Omarion's Handbook","",0,0,0,60,"B",60},{9246,"Icy Scale Breastplate","Craftsman Wilhelm",1423,71.24,49.9,60,"B",60}},1},{9245,"Icy Scale Gauntlets","B",60,60,"Craftsman Wilhelm","Eastern Plaguelands",1423,71.24,49.9,"","Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 5 Frozen Runes, 16 Heavy Scorpid Scale, 5 Essence of Water, 3 Cured Rugged Hides and 200 gold.","Omarion's Handbook",0,0,"",{22666},{},"Thanks to you and Omarion (May he rest in peace), I am now able to create Icy Scale gauntlets. All you need to do is bring me the materials and pay a small crafting fee.",1423,71.24,49.9,{{9233,"Omarion's Handbook","",0,0,0,60,"B",60},{9245,"Icy Scale Gauntlets","Craftsman Wilhelm",1423,71.24,49.9,60,"B",60}},1},{9112,"Leggings of Faith","B",60,60,"Father Inigo Montoy","Eastern Plaguelands",1423,71.66,48.58,"","Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Leggings of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Leggings, 20 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals.","Echoes of War",0,0,"200 Argent Dawn",{22513},{},"<Father Montoy makes some strange gestures in the air in front of you.>\n\nBlessed boy, have you found the vestments of the fallen? The poor souls whose last breaths were taken on the field of battle - stripped of everything including their dignity.\n\nBring me the desecrated remnants of the departed along with reagents of purification and you shall know faith.",1423,71.66,48.58,{{9121,"The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas","Archmage Angela Dosantos",1423,71.7,48.69,60,"B",60},{9033,"Echoes of War","Commander Eligor Dawnbringer",1423,71.72,48.59,60,"B",60},{9112,"Leggings of Faith","Father Inigo Montoy",1423,71.66,48.58,60,"B",60}},1},{9233,"Omarion's Handbook","B",60,60,"","",0,0,0,"Craftsman Wilhelm","Take Omarion's Handbook to Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.","",0,0,"",{},{},"Wilhelm,\n\nIf you are reading this, I have perished - finally. I want you to know that my dying thoughts revolved around you and your ineptitude when it comes to tradeskills. Unfortunately, the bearer of this handbook is in even worse shape than you in regards to crafting.\n\nAbout the book: These are the rest of my recipes. Make the bearer of this book whatever they request. I'm sure you will charge a hefty fee for your services because you are, after all, a bastard.\n\nIn Disdain,\n\nOmarion",1423,71.24,49.9,{},1},{9109,"Plagueheart Belt","B",60,60,"Mataus the Wrathcaster","Eastern Plaguelands",1423,71.58,48.65,"","Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Plagueheart Belt if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Belt, 8 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Arcane Crystals and 2 Mooncloth.","Echoes of War",0,0,"200 Argent Dawn",{22510},{},"I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.\n\nAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die; but I've already explained this...",1423,71.58,48.65,{{9121,"The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas","Archmage Angela Dosantos",1423,71.7,48.69,60,"B",60},{9033,"Echoes of War","Commander Eligor Dawnbringer",1423,71.72,48.59,60,"B",60},{9109,"Plagueheart Belt","Mataus the Wrathcaster",1423,71.58,48.65,60,"B",60}},1},{9110,"Plagueheart Bindings","B",60,60,"Mataus the Wrathcaster","Eastern Plaguelands",1423,71.58,48.65,"","Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Bindings if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Bindings, 6 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 1 Arcane Crystal and 1 Nexus Crystal.","Echoes of War",0,0,"200 Argent Dawn",{22511},{},"I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.\n\nAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die; but I've already explained this...",1423,71.58,48.65,{{9121,"The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas","Archmage Angela Dosantos",1423,71.7,48.69,60,"B",60},{9033,"Echoes of War","Commander Eligor Dawnbringer",1423,71.72,48.59,60,"B",60},{9110,"Plagueheart Bindings","Mataus the Wrathcaster",1423,71.58,48.65,60,"B",60}},1},{9105,"Plagueheart Circlet","B",60,60,"Mataus the Wrathcaster","Eastern Plaguelands",1423,71.58,48.65,"","Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Plagueheart Circlet if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Circlet, 15 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 3 Mooncloth and 3 Nexus Crystals.","Echoes of War",0,0,"200 Argent Dawn",{22506},{},"I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.\n\nAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die; but I've already explained this...",1423,71.58,48.65,{{9121,"The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas","Archmage Angela Dosantos",1423,71.7,48.69,60,"B",60},{9033,"Echoes of War","Commander Eligor Dawnbringer",1423,71.72,48.59,60,"B",60},{9105,"Plagueheart Circlet","Mataus the Wrathcaster",1423,71.58,48.65,60,"B",60}},1},{9108,"Plagueheart Gl