o me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",1423,71.72,48.59,{{9121,"The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas","Archmage Angela Dosantos",1423,71.7,48.69,60,"B",60},{9033,"Echoes of War","Commander Eligor Dawnbringer",1423,71.72,48.59,60,"B",60},{9043,"Redemption Tunic","Commander Eligor Dawnbringer",1423,71.72,48.59,60,"B",60}},1},{9050,"Redemption Wristguards","B",60,60,"Commander Eligor Dawnbringer","Eastern Plaguelands",1423,71.72,48.59,"","Commander Eligor Dawnbringer at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Redemption Wristguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Wristguards, 6 Wartorn Plate Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 2 Cured Rugged Hides.","Echoes of War",0,0,"200 Argent Dawn",{22424},{},"You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas. Bring those desecrated keepsakes to me along with wartorn plate scraps and crafting materials capable of revitalizing the cursed armor and I shall craft a fine piece of armor for you.",1423,71.72,48.59,{{9121,"The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas","Archmage Angela Dosantos",1423,71.7,48.69,60,"B",60},{9033,"Echoes of War","Commander Eligor Dawnbringer",1423,71.72,48.59,60,"B",60},{9050,"Redemption Wristguards","Commander Eligor Dawnbringer",1423,71.72,48.59,60,"B",60}},1},{9111,"Robe of Faith","B",60,60,"Father Inigo Montoy","Eastern Plaguelands",1423,71.66,48.58,"","Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Robe of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Robe, 25 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals.","Echoes of War",0,0,"200 Argent Dawn",{22512},{},"<Father Montoy makes some strange gestures in the air in front of you.>\n\nBlessed boy, have you found the vestments of the fallen? The poor souls whose last breaths were taken on the field of battle - stripped of everything including their dignity.\n\nBring me the desecrated remnants of the departed along with reagents of purification and you shall know faith.",1423,71.66,48.58,{{9121,"The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas","Archmage Angela Dosantos",1423,71.7,48.69,60,"B",60},{9033,"Echoes of War","Commander Eligor Dawnbringer",1423,71.72,48.59,60,"B",60},{9111,"Robe of Faith","Father Inigo Montoy",1423,71.66,48.58,60,"B",60}},1},{9115,"Sandals of Faith","B",60,60,"Father Inigo Montoy","Eastern Plaguelands",1423,71.66,48.58,"","Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Sandals of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Sandals, 12 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Mooncloth and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.","Echoes of War",0,0,"200 Argent Dawn",{22516},{},"<Father Montoy makes some strange gestures in the air in front of you.>\n\nBlessed boy, have you found the vestments of the fallen? The poor souls whose last breaths were taken on the field of battle - stripped of everything including their dignity.\n\nBring me the desecrated remnants of the departed along with reagents of purification and you shall know faith.",1423,71.66,48.58,{{9121,"The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas","Archmage Angela Dosantos",1423,71.7,48.69,60,"B",60},{9033,"Echoes of War","Commander Eligor Dawnbringer",1423,71.72,48.59,60,"B",60},{9115,"Sandals of Faith","Father Inigo Montoy",1423,71.66,48.58,60,"B",60}},1},{9114,"Shoulderpads of Faith","B",60,60,"Father Inigo Montoy","Eastern Plaguelands",1423,71.66,48.58,"","Father Inigo Montoy at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Shoulderpads of Faith if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Shoulderpads, 12 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Mooncloth and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.","Echoes of War",0,0,"200 Argent Dawn",{22515},{},"<Father Montoy makes some strange gestures in the air in front of you.>\n\nBlessed boy, have you found the vestments of the fallen? The poor souls whose last breaths were taken on the field of battle - stripped of everything including their dignity.\n\nBring me the desecrated remnants of the departed along with reagents of purification and you shall know faith.",1423,71.66,48.58,{{9121,"The Dread Citadel - Naxxramas","Archmage Angela Dosantos",1423,71.7,48.69,60,"B",60},{9033,"Echoes of War","Commander Eligor Dawnbringer",1423,71.72,48.59,60,"B",60},{9114,"Shoulderpads of Faith","Father Inigo Montoy",1423,71.66,48.58,60,"B",60}},1},{9120,"The Fall of Kel'Thuzad","B",60,60,"","",0,0,0,"Father Inigo Montoy","Take the Phylactery of Kel'Thuzad to Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands.","",1100,0,"200 Argent Dawn, 200 Argent Dawn, 200 Argent Dawn, 200 Argent Dawn",{},{23206,23207},"The phylactery is all that remains of the master of Naxxramas. Your better judgment dictates that you destroy the phylactery, preventing the lich from ever reforming. Thankfully, you seldom listen to that internal voice of reason.\n\nSomeone at Light's Hope will pay you hugely for this artifact. Who cares if Kel'Thuzad regenerates to full power?",1423,71.66,48.58,{},1},{9229,"The Fate of Ramaladni","B",60,60,"Korfax, Champion of the Light","Eastern Plaguelands",1423,71.95,48.52,"","Enter Naxxramas and uncover the Fate of Ramaladni.","",725,19800,"200 Argent Dawn",{},{},"Ramaladni was a warrior of the Brotherhood - a pupil of Highlord Mograine before the Dawn even existed! When news of Mograine's death reached him, hatred and anger took over.\n\nUnderstand this, {name}, when rage and retribution take the reins, a man ceases to be a man. The man personifies the emotions that control him instead. And so it would be that Ramaladni, the spirit of retribution, would enter Naxxramas to exact vengeance... and never return.\n\nEnter Naxxramas and find what became of Ramaladni.",1423,71.95,48.52,{{9229,"The Fate of Ramaladni","Korfax, Champion of the Light",1423,71.95,48.52,60,"B",60},{9230,"Ramaladni's Icy Grasp","Korfax, Champion of the Light",1423,71.95,48.52,60,"B",60}},1},{9232,"The Only Song I Know...","B",60,60,"Craftsman Wilhelm","Eastern Plaguelands",1423,71.24,49.9,"","Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants you to bring him 2 Frozen Runes, 2 Essence of Water, 2 Blue Sapphires and 30 gold pieces.","",725,0,"200 Argent Dawn",{},{22700,22699,22702,22701},"You fancy yourself a hero of the Dawn, eh? I've seen our greatest soldiers get rolled over by Kel'Thuzad's plebes! How well could someone so clueless possibly fare in Naxxramas?\n\n<Wilhelm sighs.>\n\nBah, what choice do I got? You're the best I can do; I may as well help you.\n\nOmarion left me with one recipe. It's the only song I know... I can make a few variations of these pants; you just gotta supply the materials.",1423,71.24,49.9,{},1},{66281,"Book of Deathstones","",0,0,"","",0,0,0,"","","",0,0,"",{},{},"You open the aged and weathered tome and discover text detailing a necromantic ritual. Perhaps Archmage Tarsis would be interested in having this information.",0,0,0,{},0},{66286,"Book of Deathstones","",0,0,"","",0,0,0,"","","",0,0,"",{},{},"You open the aged and weathered tome and discover text detailing a necromantic ritual. Perhaps Archmage Tarsis would be interested in having this information.",0,0,0,{},0},{66287,"Book of Deathstones","",0,0,"","",0,0,0,"","","",0,0,"",{},{},"You open the aged and weathered tome and discover text detailing a necromantic ritual. Perhaps Archmage Tarsis would be interested in having this information.",0,0,0,{},0},{66288,"Book of Deathstones","",0,0,"","",0,0,0,"","","",0,0,"",{},{},"You open the aged and weathered tome and discover text detailing a necromantic ritual. Perhaps Archmage Tarsis would be interested in having this information.",0,0,0,{},0},{66289,"Book of Deathstones","",0,0,"","",0,0,0,"","","",0,0,"",{},{},"You open the aged and weathered tome and discover text detailing a necromantic ritual. Perhaps Archmage Tarsis would be interested in having this information.",0,0,0,{},0},{66290,"Book of Deathstones","",0,0,"","",0,0,0,"","","",0,0,"",{},{},"You open the aged and weathered tome and discover text detailing a necromantic ritual. Perhaps Archmage Tarsis would be interested in having this information.",0,0,0,{},0},{66291,"Book of Deathstones","",0,0,"","",0,0,0,"","","",0,0,"",{},{},"You open the aged and weathered tome and discover text detailing a necromantic ritual. Perhaps Archmage Tarsis would be interested in having this information.",0,0,0,{},0},{66292,"Book of Deathstones","",0,0,"","",0,0,0,"","","",0,0,"",{},{},"You open the aged and weathered tome and discover text detailing a necromantic ritual. Perhaps Archmage Tarsis would be interested in having this information.",0,0,0,{},0},{66293,"Book of Deathstones","",0,0,"","",0,0,0,"","","",0,0,"",{},{},"You open the aged and weathered tome and discover text detailing a necromantic ritual. Perhaps Archmage Tarsis would be interested in having this information.",0,0,0,{},0},{66294,"Book of Deathstones","",0,0,"","",0,0,0,"","","",0,0,"",{},{},"You open the aged and weathered tome and discover text detailing a necromantic ritual. Perhaps Archmage Tarsis would be interested in having this information.",0,0,0,{},0},{66295,"Book of Deathstones","",0,0,"","",0,0,0,"","","",0,0,"",{},{},"You open the aged and weathered tome and discover text detailing a necromantic ritual. Perhaps Archmage Tarsis would be interested in having this information.",0,0,0,{},0},{66317,"Book of Deathstones","",0,0,"","",0,0,0,"","","",0,0,"",{},{},"You open the aged and weathered tome and discover text detailing a necromantic ritual. Perhaps Archmage Tarsis would be interested in having this information.",0,0,0,{},0},{66318,"Book of Deathstones","",0,0,"","",0,0,0,"","","",0,0,"",{},{},"You open the aged and weathered tome and discover text detailing a necromantic ritual. Perhaps Archmage Tarsis would be interested in having this information.",0,0,0,{},0},{88729,"Ramaladni's Icy Grasp","",0,0,"","",0,0,0,"","","",725,0,"200 Argent Dawn",{},{},"Fixing this band may prove to be quite challenging, {name}. You see, it was made from the very runes that form inside Scourge structures - like Naxxramas. Additional materials are also required but your main concern should be getting those frozen runes. Bring me what I need and I will restore the ring to its former glory.",0,0,0,{},0},{87360,"The Fall of Kel'Thuzad","",0,0,"","",0,0,0,"","","",1100,0,"200 Argent Dawn, 200 Argent Dawn, 200 Argent Dawn, 200 Argent Dawn",{},{},"The phylactery is all that remains of the master of Naxxramas. Your better judgment dictates that you destroy the phylactery, preventing the lich from ever reforming. Thankfully, you seldom listen to that internal voice of reason.\n\nSomeone at Light's Hope will pay you hugely for this artifact. Who cares if Kel'Thuzad regenerates to full power?",0,0,0,{},0},{88730,"The Only Song I Know...","",0,0,"","",0,0,0,"","","",725,0,"200 Argent Dawn",{},{},"You fancy yourself a hero of the Dawn, eh? I've seen our greatest soldiers get rolled over by Kel'Thuzad's plebes! How well could someone so clueless possibly fare in Naxxramas?\n\n<Wilhelm sighs.>\n\nBah, what choice do I got? You're the best I can do; I may as well help you.\n\nOmarion left me with one recipe. It's the only song I know... I can make a few variations of these pants; you just gotta supply the materials.",0,0,0,{},0},{66145,"The Power in Death","",0,0,"","",0,0,0,"","","",0,18000,"",{},{},"{name}, I have a task for you.\n\nWithin this citadel lies a dark art that breeds despair in mortal hearts and pushes everything towards a state of death and decay. Kel'Thuzad and his underlings possess a singular affinity for this power.. the essence of death itself.\n\nBring me a sample of this energy, so that I may study it. In my current state, I care not for what it does to me...",0,0,0,{},0},{66193,"The Power in Death","",0,0,"","",0,0,0,"","","",0,27000,"",{},{},"Death holds sway over every living thing.. it isn't something you can run from when it comes for you.\n\nYet even in this evil, I believe we can extract power from its essence through the form of deathstones.\n\nInvestigate Naxxramas further and gather me more information.",0,0,0,{},0}}},["mats"]={[118]={{3371,1,"Empty Vial",4,"v"},{2678,1,"Mild Spices",2,"v"},{2447,1,"Peacebloom",132,"a"}},[724]={{723,1,"Goretusk Liver",213,"a"},{2678,1,"Mild Spices",2,"v"}},[733]={{729,1,"Stringy Vulture Meat",111,"a"},{730,1,"Murloc Eye",108,"a"},{731,1,"Goretusk Snout",29,"a"}},[787]={{6303,1,"Raw Slitherskin Mackerel",18,"a"}},[858]={{3371,1,"Empty Vial",4,"v"},{2678,2,"Mild Spices",2,"v"},{2450,1,"Briarthorn",165,"a"}},[929]={{3372,1,"Leaded Vial",40,"v"},{2692,1,"Hot Spices",40,"v"},{2453,1,"Bruiseweed",125,"a"}},[1017]={{1015,2,"Lean Wolf Flank",313,"a"},{2678,1,"Mild Spices",2,"v"}},[1082]={{1081,1,"Crisp Spider Meat",50,"a"},{1080,1,"Tough Condor Meat",1076,"a"}},[1251]={{2589,1,"Linen Cloth",29,"a"}},[1710]={{3372,1,"Leaded Vial",40,"v"},{2692,3,"Hot Spices",40,"v"},{3357,1,"Liferoot",323,"a"}},[2300]={{2318,8,"Light Leather",77,"a"},{2320,4,"Coarse Thread",10,"v"}},[2302]={{2318,2,"Light Leather",77,"a"},{2320,1,"Coarse Thread",10,"v"}},[2303]={{2318,4,"Light Leather",77,"a"},{2320,1,"Coarse Thread",10,"v"}},[2304]={{2318,1,"Light Leather",77,"a"}},[2307]={{2318,7,"Light Leather",77,"a"},{2320,2,"Coarse Thread",10,"v"}},[2308]={{2318,10,"Light Leather",77,"a"},{2321,2,"Fine Thread",99,"a"}},[2309]={{2318,8,"Light Leather",77,"a"},{2320,5,"Coarse Thread",10,"v"}},[2310]={{2318,5,"Light Leather",77,"a"},{2320,2,"Coarse Thread",10,"v"}},[2311]={{2318,8,"Light Leather",77,"a"},{2320,2,"Coarse Thread",10,"v"},{2324,1,"Bleach",24,"a"}},[2312]={{4231,1,"Cured Light Hide",149,"a"},{2318,4,"Light Leather",77,"a"},{2320,2,"Coarse Thread",10,"v"}},[2313]={{2319,4,"Medium Leather",124,"a"},{2320,1,"Coarse Thread",10,"v"}},[2314]={{2319,10,"Medium Leather",124,"a"},{4231,2,"Cured Light Hide",149,"a"},{2321,2,"Fine Thread",99,"a"}},[2315]={{2319,4,"Medium Leather",124,"a"},{2321,2,"Fine Thread",99